      "pali": "5. Mahāyaññavagga ",
      "english": "5. A Great Sacrifice "
    },
    {
      "number": 3,
      "pali": "Paṭhamaaggisutta ",
      "english": "Fires (1st) "
    },
    {
      "number": 4,
      "pali": "“Sattime, bhikkhave, aggī. ",
      "english": "“Mendicants, there are these seven fires. "
    },
    {
      "number": 5,
      "pali": "Katame satta? ",
      "english": "What seven? "
    },
    {
      "number": 6,
      "pali": "Rāgaggi, dosaggi, mohaggi, āhuneyyaggi, gahapataggi, dakkhiṇeyyaggi, kaṭṭhaggi—",
      "english": "The fires of greed, hate, delusion. The fire of those worthy of offerings dedicated to the gods. A householder’s fire. The fire of those worthy of a religious donation. And a wood fire. "
    },
    {
      "number": 7,
      "pali": "ime kho, bhikkhave, satta aggī”ti. ",
      "english": "These are the seven fires.” "
    },
    {
      "number": 8,
      "pali": "Tatiyaṁ. ",
      "english": ""
    }
